	(text "UTIL-01 ATTENUVERTER - dual precision attenuverter with offset normalling, 6HP\nPer channel: OPA2197 unity-gain input buffer (1M input) into a single op-amp attenuverter, 0.1% 100k, 10p C0G across R_f.\nVout = (2k - 1) * Vin; k = pot fraction (CW = +1x, CCW = -1x).\nUnpatched inputs are normalled to OFFSET, a REF5050 5.000 V reference: bipolar offset source.\nSMD and power header on the back (JLCPCB assembly side); jacks and pots on the front.\nJ2.TN, J4.TN and U3.3 (TEMP) intentionally unconnected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "959069ec-6fc1-5221-a22c-dea01e73ec91")
